From ef50139b277724bc45585695cd6a51af7a2c397d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 20:54:40 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 08102/11362] The outcome I first chose was the treatment
 wearing a different name, so it was swapped before the run

76% of induced engines that CAN run still cannot yield a plan, and the cause is the goal, not the
dynamics. Every intervention this week targeted the engine. This is the harness, pre-registration
and CPU pre-flight for the first one that targets the goal. (The code half -- the two default-OFF
knobs, CARNOT_ARC_INDUCE_GOAL_DEFECT_CHECK and CARNOT_ARC_GOAL_PROMPT_TRANSITIONS -- landed in
102d4cb33c, swept in by a concurrent session's `git add -A`; nothing was lost, but the attribution
belongs here.)

THE METHODOLOGICAL POINT, which is most of the value of this commit. plan_found is an EXACT
function of the goal gate's kind, so scoring a goal intervention against it grades the goal gate
with the goal gate. The replacement primary was "discriminates on held-out frames" -- disjoint
data, real observed frames, not the gate. Then it was measured rather than assumed:

  * frame-set agreement between the treatment's probe set and the outcome's scoring set: 94.8%.
    "Disjoint" bought a 5.2% gap, not independence.
  * and worse, EVERY predicate the accept check would KEEP scores positive on it -- 6 of 6, FN=0.
    The gate's accept decision DETERMINES the outcome. That is the same circularity as
    plan_found, one indirection out, in the metric chosen to escape it.

So the primary was swapped to "fires at the real pre-win frame AND not at the level's opening
board", which the gate does not determine (2 of 6 kept predicates still fail it) and which no
constant-True predicate can satisfy. It costs power -- base rate 0.104 -> 0.061 -- and that trade
is stated, not hidden: ~63% power for a 3x effect, ~40% for 2.5x. Recorded as AMENDMENT_2 in the
pre-registration, before the first LLM call and before any outcome in this run existed.

CPU PRE-FLIGHT, all before any GPU time, each a finding on its own:

  * LEVEL-UP ANATOMY. On 20/20 windows the level-up is the last transition and always lands in
    the held-out tail, and the frame AFTER it changes a median 25.8x an ordinary step -- a
    wholesale board replacement, i.e. the NEXT level's opening board. There is no frame in the
    record that shows a completed level. REQ-ARC-WMTE-5714's `_levelup_positive_recall` scores
    win-recognition on exactly that frame -- the same frame the 2026-07-29 win-state-poison
    correction was about. Demoted to a caveated secondary, not quietly dropped.
  * 88.7% of induced goals are FALSE on every single frame the agent ever observed.
  * DETECTOR COVERAGE 94.8%, against the taxonomy's 52% estimate from the syntactic classes --
    a runtime constancy probe also catches the whole-board and colour-elimination tropes. This
    is reported as a LIMIT on what may be claimed, not as a win: at 94.8% firing the treatment
    is near-unconditional resampling, so a positive result means "resampling the goal under a
    nudge helps", never "the check's selectivity helps".
  * It also rejects 6 of the 12 goals that DID discriminate. Bounded (a re-ask can only replace
    a sample) but real, and stated.

THE HARNESS. One server, both arms, non-default port, CUDA build proven from /proc/<pid>/exe,
n_ctx read back from /props. Seeded sampler so control and treatment share attempt 0 exactly and
diverge only where the gate fires. Three arms: control, treatment, and a same-arm/different-seed
A/A floor run through the identical test. Game-clustered permutation test, because treating
replicates as trials inflated a sibling p from 0.125 to 0.049 and had to be corrected. An
ARMEDNESS GATE that reports NON-TEST rather than null if the treatment never fired, because a
sibling shipped a silent no-op across 162 arms and read it as "both settings measured". A missing
observation is excluded and counted per arm, never scored zero.

Wiring is proven end-to-end against a scripted fake server before any GPU time, because three
knobs on this exact code path were found DEAD in one week. The load-bearing case is the goal-only
call shape, which the engine gate could never reach.

Repo roots derived from `Path(__file__)`, not hardcoded (Test-Run Record Integrity rule 4).

